r\n			<p class="MsoNormal">\r\n			<span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #006699">Elaboraci&oacute;n prototipo</span>\r\n			</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td width="295" valign="top" style="width: 221.35pt; border: 1.5pt inset; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 27.1pt">\r\n			<p class="MsoNormal">\r\n			<span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #006699">Fabricaci&oacute;n cavidades prototipo H&amp;O</span>\r\n			</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td width="187" valign="top" style="width: 140pt; border: 1.5pt inset; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 27.1pt">\r\n			<p class="MsoNormal">\r\n			<span style="font-size: 10pt">NESTOR CASTILLO</span>\r\n			</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr style="height: 40pt">\r\n			<td width="156" valign="top" style="width: 116.85pt; border: 1.5pt inset; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40pt">\r\n			<p class="MsoNormal">\r\n			<span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f497d">Evaluaci&oacute;n\r\n			de cavidades prototipo en conector twist off pvc</span>\r\n			</p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td width="295" valign="top" style="width: 221.35pt; border: 1.5pt inset; padding: 0cm 5.4pt; height: 40pt">\r\n			<p style="text-indent: -18pt" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">\r\n			<!--[if !supportLists]--><strong><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif"><span>1.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n			</span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f497d">Evaluar la\r\n			membrana en el conector twist off de PVC de las cavidades prototipo de manera\r\n			que soporte temperatura de esterilizaci&oacute;n a 129 &deg;C</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f497d"> y garantizar la integridad de la\r\n			membrana en diferentes espesores para definir especificaci&oacute;n.</span>\r\n			</p>\r\n			<p style="text-indent: -18pt" class="MsoLi